 "construction": "Brutal, from the Pass 2 gun (kept: octagonal cast pedestal, toothed slewing ring, trunnion plates, yellow roof armour, muzzle brake). New proportions - the mass moves from the pedestal to the weapon: a thick finned barrel jacket with two recoil cylinders runs the full length of the cradle, the receiver is a box mantlet with a sloped yellow glacis, the muzzle brake is longer and double-baffled, the trunnion plates are thicker with hex bearing caps; ammunition box at the back; the recoil buffer, the bolt handle and the elevation gear are bigger and visible",
 "style_character": "heavy machinery: bare gun-metal, exposed mechanisms, bolts, ribs, gussets, cast surface",
